sequenceDiagram
    participant AppA as APP A (Worker)
    participant AppB as APP B (Worker)
    participant Kernel as 内核 (Lifecycle / Messaging)
    participant CommHub as CommHub
    participant KernelUI as UI (React)
    participant OtherApp as Other APP

    %% STATE_UPDATE: Worker -> UI
    Note over AppA,CommHub: 仅 NoWorker/虚拟沙箱路径下 STATE_UPDATE 先经 requestAnimationFrame 帧对齐节流<br/>（lifecycle.js:sandboxSelf.postMessage）；真实 Worker 直接 onmessage
    AppA->>CommHub: handleMsg(pid, {type:'STATE_UPDATE', payload:state})
    CommHub->>CommHub: stateCache.set(pid, state)
    CommHub->>KernelUI: notify(subscribers, {type:'STATE', payload:state})

    %% UI_ACTION: UI -> Worker
    KernelUI->>Kernel: dispatch(pid, action)
    Kernel->>Kernel: action.type === 'KERNEL_CALL' && payload?
    alt KERNEL_CALL
        Kernel->>Kernel: 系统应用 → systemSwitch / 非系统 → notSystemSwitch
    else UI_ACTION
        Kernel->>AppA: postMessage({type:'UI_ACTION', payload:action})
    end

    %% evokeApp: 跨应用唤起（= activate(reason:'interaction')）
    AppB->>Kernel: kernel.evokeApp({pid, from, interactInfo})
    Kernel->>Kernel: activate({pid, reason:'interaction', interactInfo, from})
    Kernel->>Kernel: newInteractInfo = {...interactInfo, from}，再 startProcess({pid, interactInfo:newInteractInfo})
    alt 冷启动
        Kernel->>AppA: postMessage({type:'RESTORE'|'INIT', payload:保存的 state})
        Note over Kernel,AppA: interactInfo 不搭 INIT/RESTORE 的车：<br/>建好进程后另发一条 APP_INTERACT
    else 从 HIBERNATED 唤醒
        Kernel->>Kernel: app.status = 'RUNNING'
    else 本来就在 RUNNING
        Kernel->>Kernel: 不再启动，直接投递
    end
    Kernel->>AppA: postMessage({type:'APP_INTERACT', payload:newInteractInfo})
    Kernel->>CommHub: emitChange({type:'APP_FOCUS', pid})
    CommHub->>KernelUI: 系统事件 APP_FOCUS → DeskBook 置前（restore 不发）

    %% Pub/Sub 主题消息
    AppB->>CommHub: postMessage({type:'PUBLISH_TOPIC', payload:{topic, data}})
    CommHub->>CommHub: publish(topic, data) → topicSubscribers.get(topic)
    CommHub->>OtherApp: 主机端订阅回调（UI 侧 callback(data)）
    CommHub->>AppA: sendToWorker({type:'TOPIC_MESSAGE', payload:{topic, data}})
    AppA->>AppA: dispatch({type:'TOPIC_MESSAGE', topic, data})

    %% InteractiveAwakening 中间件
    AppB->>KernelUI: InteractiveAwakening {visible, type, interactInfo}
    KernelUI->>KernelUI: 用户选择目标 APP
    KernelUI->>Kernel: evokeApp({pid: 选择结果, from, interactInfo})
